  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "Researchers scanning the Giza plateau in Egypt with radar from space say they later changed their method so they could pick up structures deep underground, beneath the pyramids. A researcher named Filippo Biondi, who took part in the work, tells Michels that with the new setup \"we were able to detect, to measure the structure that were underneath.\" If true, it would mean large, unknown structures lie under the pyramids."
